# Bootstrap config only. Every site block is rendered from the DB and pushed via
# the admin API, so this file must stay free of routes.
#
# Each rendered route carries its own `encode zstd gzip` and disabled access log;
# Caddy access logs are off by default because they cost CPU and disk on a small box.
